      "lines": [
        "意义。",
        "因此，数式或者有一个值，或者根本就没有值。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列各式的值：",
        "а) $2.345\\times100$；　　б) $3.71\\div10$；　　в) $1000\\times0.07$；",
        "г) $0.031\\times10000$；　д) $5.1\\times0.3$；　е) $0.46\\div0.2$；",
        "ж) $4.16\\div4$；　　　　з) $0\\times17.3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "计算：",
        "а) $1\\frac{2}{3}+\\frac{5}{6}$；　　　б) $5-3\\frac{2}{7}$；　　　в) $\\frac{4}{9}\\times\\frac{27}{32}$；",
        "г) $\\frac{3}{8}\\div(-\\frac{9}{16})$；　д) $\\frac{11}{24}\\times72$；　е) $\\frac{37}{63}\\times(-21)$；",
        "ж) $1\\frac{2}{7}\\times14$；　　　　　з) $-3\\frac{2}{9}\\times3$；　и) $\\frac{4}{7}\\times(-4.9)$；",
        "к) $(-0.15)\\times\\frac{2}{3}$；　　　л) $(-16)\\div(-\\frac{4}{9})$；",
        "м) $\\frac{3}{4}\\div(-9)$."
      ]
    },
    {
